{"id":"massnahme","lemma":"Maßnahme","pos":"noun","rank":4257,"glosses":["measure (tactic or strategy)","sanction","scheme"],"ipa":"/ˈmaːsnaːmə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/De-Ma%C3%9Fnahme.ogg/De-Ma%C3%9Fnahme.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Maßnahme","plural":"Maßnahmen"},"examples":[{"text":"Solche Maßnahmen waren nicht nötig.","en":"Such measures were not necessary.","words":[{"g":"such","l":"solch"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"urgently"}]},{"text":"Ich denke, das wäre eine gute Maßnahme.","en":"I think doing that would be a good idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Die Schule ergreift Maßnahmen.","en":"The school is taking action.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to seize, capture","l":"ergreifen"},null]},{"text":"Diese Maßnahmen können die Ausbreitung der Krankheit verhindern.","en":"These measures can prevent the disease from spreading.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695488","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"expansion"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sickness, illness"},{"g":"to prevent"}]},{"text":"Das hohe Haus hat der Maßnahme bereits zugestimmt.","en":"The House has already approved the measure.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"high, tall","l":"hoch"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"to agree","l":"zustimmen"}]}]}